Using the `alpha_merged` object:

- Create a figure comparing Shannon diversity between whole and dissected samples (`Whole_or_dissected`).
- Create a second figure comparing Simpson diversity between whole and dissected samples.
- Use an appropriate ggplot2 geometry to display the distribution of each diversity metric.
