# Part 3 — Testing the hypotheses

**H1:** *Rickettsia* relative abundance will be higher in gut samples than in other sample types.

**H2:** Whole-tick samples will have higher microbial alpha diversity than dissected samples, as measured by the Shannon and Simpson indices.

For H1 you will use a figure and the numbers of samples per type; no statistical test is asked for. For H2 you will use *t*-tests.

